Exp Z': Scope of Lemma 1 (ℓ-rank obstruction) vs. p mod ℓ residue
========================================================================

THEORY SUMMARY:
  p ≡ 1 mod ℓ: p+1 ≡ 2, t≡2, #E^t≡4 ≢ 0  ⟹ Lemma holds.  ✓
  p ≡ 2 mod ℓ: p+1 ≡ 0, t≡0, #E^t≡0       ⟹ Lemma FAILS!  ✗
  B5 (Corollary) holds for ALL p: #J=n_E·n_Et≈p² by Honda-Tate.  ✓

